<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 13-month bond auction for Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 13-month bond auction for Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish central bank said the Treasury would auction on Tuesday 13-month bonds after it sold 217.7 trln lira of one-year t-bills on March 11.</p>
<p>The Treasury has 89.83 trillion lira of domestic debt repayments due on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : April 22, 1998</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>    Auction date: March 18, 1997</p>
<p>    Value date  : March 19, 1997</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75 GAT EKS</p>
